            "review_text": "Getaway46046740770\n1 contribution\n0\nUseless and no understanding of actual coffee culture!\nFeb 2024 • Solo\nSo seriously, you can't get an Americano coffee and have them add some milk to it! They claim it's a black coffee and even though the carton of milk was sitting there, they couldn't/wouldn't add any! It's just black with sugar...well no, it's coffee and if you add sugar, you can certainly add some milk!! I did offer to pay additional for milk btw and you can pay for a small cup of milk as well! Literally makes no sense to me and definitely would not recommend to travellers! Vietnam has embraced western culture with a bang and there was never any issue to get an Americano with milk anywhere in the city as an FYI\nRead more\nWritten February 24, 2024",
