            "review_text": "Go10914283317\n1 contribution\n1\nThe store is too rich and does not want to sell to Vietnamese people\nOct 2023 • Family\nDetermined to go to the airport to eat Pho, but when I arrived at the place to order Pho, the staff said it was out of Pho.\nA quick look at the Pho counter saw Pho noodles, broth, and meat.\nGo back and tell the staff why the other item isn't for sale???\nIf you don't want to sell it, the staff member said you're out of broth. The pot of broth was steaming and fragrant, but the staff member said it was a pot of uncooked bones and was bland.\nOk... coming to Airport Pho during a sad economic period and not even bothering to sell it, you know how rich this restaurant at the airport is.\nI have reduced my weight but luckily I still have a package of snacks and a cup of milk tea for my daughter to temporarily eat :)))))\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten November 21, 2023",
